# 01 - Basic Device Configuration & Boot System

## 1. Security & Device Setup
```cisco
enable
configure terminal

! Hostname & Enkripsi Password
hostname Sw-Core-01
enable secret class
service password-encryption

! Console & Remote Access (VTY)
line console 0
 password cisco
 login
exit

line vty 0 4
 password cisco
 login
exit

! Banner Warning
banner motd " Authorized Access Only! "

! Mengatur IOS image file saat startup
boot system flash:c2960-lanbasek9-mz.150-2.SE4.bin

! Simpan Konfigurasi
end
copy running-config startup-config

! Verifikasi Hasil Config
show running-config
show boot
show version
